{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Co-op Kaiju Horror Cooking",
    "steam_appid": 3139570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/1fa8bbcc413459268adfed26af884325.avif?t=1754326254\" width=616 height=75 /></span><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1754326254\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1754326254\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/4e6740f694d6e422e07e45caacf1cbc5.avif?t=1754326254\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/1fa8bbcc413459268adfed26af884325.avif?t=1754326254\" width=616 height=75 /></span><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1754326254\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1754326254\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1754326254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/4e6740f694d6e422e07e45caacf1cbc5.avif?t=1754326254\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p>",
